      "hint_steps": [
        "先看指数里的整体 3x²+1，而不只是 x²。",
        "设 u=3x²+1，则 du=6x dx，正好对应外面的因子。",
        "换元后对 exp(u) 积分，再完整换回。"
      ],
      "formula_html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>⁢</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>⁢</mo><msup><mi>ⅇ</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⁢</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>",
      "answer_html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>ⅇ</mi><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⁢</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></math>",
      "solution_steps": [
        "设 u=3x²+1，则 du=6x dx。",
        "原式化为 ∫exp(u) du=exp(u)+C。",
        "换回得到 exp(3x²+1)+C。",
        "对结果求导，链式法则给出 6x·exp(3x²+1)，与被积式相同。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "substitution_guided_polynomial",
      "skill": "substitution",
      "phase": "guided",
      "kind": "indefinite",
      "integrand": "(2*x+1)*(x^2+x+1)^2",
      "answer": "(x^2+x+1)^3/3+C",
      "source": "临考编写的训练题；不是任何高校真题。",
      "hint_steps": [
        "被平方的整体是 x²+x+1，先求这个整体的导数。",
        "设 u=x²+x+1，则 du=(2x+1)dx。",
        "换元后是 ∫u² du；用幂函数积分公式，再换回并加 C。"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "设 u=x²+x+1，求导得 du=(2x+1)dx。",
        "原式变为 ∫u² du=u³/3+C。",
        "换回 x，结果为 (x²+x+1)³/3+C。",
        "求导时外层的 3 与分母 3 抵消，再乘内层导数 2x+1，得到原被积式。"
      ],
      "formula_html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⁢</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>⁢</mo><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>",
      "answer_html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>"
    },
    {
      "id": "substitution_transfer_trig",
      "skill": "substitution",
      "phase": "transfer",
      "kind": "indefinite",
      "integrand": "sin(x)*cos(x)",
      "answer": "sin(x)^2/2+C",
      "source": "临考编写的训练题；不是任何高校真题。",
      "hint_steps": [
        "相乘的两个函数中，哪一个的导数正好是另一个？",
        "可设 u=sin(x)，此时 du=cos(x)dx。",
        "剩下的是 ∫u du，用幂函数公式后换回 sin(x)。"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "设 u=sin(x)，则 du=cos(x)dx。",
        "原式变为 ∫u du=u²/2+C。",
        "换回得到 sin²(x)/2+C。输入时写 sin(x)^2/2+C。",
        "求导得到 sin(x)cos(x)。也可设 u=cos(x)，得到 -cos²(x)/2+C，两种原函数只差一个常数。"
      ],
      "formula_html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>⁢</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>",
      "answer_html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>"
    },
    {
      "id": "substitution_post_log",
      "skill": "substitution",
      "phase": "post",
      "kind": "indefinite",
      "integrand": "(2*x+1)/(x^2+x+1)",
      "answer": "ln(x^2+x+1)+C",
      "source": "临考编写的训练题；不是任何高校真题。",
      "hint_steps": [
        "比较分母 x²+x+1 的导数与分子。",
        "设 u=x²+x+1，则 du=(2x+1)dx，原式成为 ∫1/u du。",
        "1/u 的原函数是 ln|u|；本题 x²+x+1=(x+1/2)²+3/4 恒为正。"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "设 u=x²+x+1，则 du=(2x+1)dx。",
        "原式变为 ∫1/u du=ln|u|+C。",
        "因为 x²+x+1=(x+1/2)²+3/4>0，可写为 ln(x²+x+1)+C。",
        "求导检查：分子为内层导数 2x+1，分母为 x²+x+1，正好还原被积式。"
      ],
      "formula_html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⁢</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>",
      "answer_html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></math>"
    },
    {
      "id": "basic_foundation",
      "skill": "basic",
      "phase": "foundation",
      "kind": "indefinite",
      "integrand": "2*x+1",
      "answer": "x^2+x+C",
      "source": "临考编写的训练题；不是任何高校真题。",
      "hint_steps": [
        "先把 2x 和常数 1 分别积分。",
        "x 的积分是 x²/2，1 的积分是 x。",
        "保留系数 2，合并两项，并加积分常数 C。"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "拆成 ∫2x dx+∫1 dx。",
        "第一项为 2×x²/2=x²，第二项为 x。",
        "合并并加常数，得到 x²+x+C。",
        "求导得到 2x+1。补练结束后回到原来的训练位置。"
      ],
      "formula_html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>⁢</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mspace width=\"0.2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>",
      "answer_html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></math>"
    }
  ],
